# REQUIRES: verilator
# Constant-shell fold, `--csf-mailbox-builder`: the links from one producer
# class to one reader class whose producer instances are each read by one
# reader instance become lanes of one reader-indexed mailbox (a row per
# reader instance, a lane per link, a masked write at the producer's pass, a
# read of the whole row at the reader's). Driver/Inputs/mailbox: eight Src
# read four a Sink (early and late lanes; Sink's ready fans out and stays a
# link). Each variant exact against its target, channels stalled or not:
# - plain: distributed mailboxes, one of them single-banked (late lanes);
# - blk: block RAM mailboxes (`--link-block-depth 2`, read through the
#   RAM's output register);
# - cp: Src in two copies (a mailbox per producer copy);
# - zl: bubbles, shared write registers and zero-latency links;
# - slr: SLR groups with Src and Sink in one group (mailboxes there).
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/mailbox
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/plain --static --nest --modulo --compact-links --csf-single-bank --csf-mailbox-builder Src Sink 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=PLAIN
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -Mdir %t/plain/obj %S/Inputs/tb_reset.sv top.sv %t/plain/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/plain/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/plain/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+1 +stall=0 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/plain/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+2 +stall=40 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=PLAINSIM < %t/plain/foldsim_sim.mlir
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/blk --static --nest --modulo --compact-links --csf-single-bank --csf-mailbox-builder --link-block-depth 2 Src Sink 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=PLAIN
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -Mdir %t/blk/obj %S/Inputs/tb_reset.sv top.sv %t/blk/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/blk/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/blk/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+3 +stall=0 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/blk/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+4 +stall=40 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=BLKSIM < %t/blk/foldsim_sim.mlir
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/cp --static --nest --modulo --compact-links --csf-single-bank --csf-mailbox-builder --copies Src:2 --link-block-depth 2 Src Sink 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=CP
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -Mdir %t/cp/obj %S/Inputs/tb_reset.sv top.sv %t/cp/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/cp/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/cp/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+5 +stall=0 | FileCheck %s
